                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lacen gimiya lagada me pimo piny, ma obedo calo odoo, ci giwacca ni, “A icit ipim ot pa Lubaŋa, keno tyer, ki jo ma giworo Lubaŋa i ode. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 21.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ento pe ipim dyekal me ot pa Lubaŋa ma tye woko, wek meno obedi pien doŋ gityeko miyone woko bot jo ma pe giŋeyo Lubaŋa, gibibedo ka nyono gaŋ maleŋ woko pi dwe pyeraŋwen wiye aryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimiyo twero bot lucadenna aryo-ni me tito lok pi nino alip acel ki miya aryo ki pyerabicel, ma noŋo guruko boŋo cola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
