                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lacen lamalaika me abirone okuto tumme, ci dwan mogo maloŋo owinnye i polo ma wacci, “Ker me lobo doŋ odoko ker pa Rwotwa ki Kricitone, en doŋ bibedo ka loc matwal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
